WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.962
Watch and read: For your presentation practice, you are presenting on my family. What

00:00:04.962 --> 00:00:06.323
is the best answer?

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:11.915
The answer is: Face your audience. Read the instruction carefully and choose the

00:00:11.915 --> 00:00:13.365
helpful or correct response.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:18.998
Watch and read: For your presentation practice, think about this situation: You are

00:00:18.998 --> 00:00:21.581
presenting on my family. Which choice fits?

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:27.314
The answer is: Face your audience. Use the lesson skill to make a sensible choice.
